title: Neo-Soul Ballad
key: Ab
tempo: 72
style: neosoul

// A slow eight-bar form: the one and the six, a two-five into the four, the
// four made a dominant ninth on its way down to the three, and a two-five back
// to the top.
[A]
| Abmaj9 | Fm9 | Bbm9 Eb13 | Dbmaj9 |
| Db9    | Cm9 | Bbm9      | Eb13   |
